# Integration tests (*.int-spec.ts) live here.
#
# The directory is tracked while empty because jest.config.js names it as a
# project rootDir and validates every project even under --selectProjects unit.
# Untracked, a fresh clone fails with "Directory test in the rootDir option was
# not found" — which is exactly how CI failed the first time it ever got far
# enough to run the tests (D-005).
